### Normalized scores (1–100)

No scores assigned. The exact model has zero verified public benchmark numbers, so this report is self-excluded rather than introducing unsupported placeholders. Independent user reports also conflict sharply: one user reported a successful one-shot family-video edit, while others reported rapid credit depletion and no completed work. Those anecdotes are useful risk signals, not benchmark evidence.

